WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:03.108
[♪ opening theme song playing]

3
00:42.064 --> 00:48.070
THE PERFECT LIE

4
00:53.158 --> 00:54.743
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION

5
00:54.826 --> 00:58.080
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

6
01:00.582 --> 01:02.501
[♪ uneasy music plays]

7
01:03.001 --> 01:04.920
[nurse] Sir, you can go in now.

8
02:26.585 --> 02:29.045
I wanted to talk to you face-to-face.

9
02:30.422 --> 02:31.923
So I came to see you.

10
02:33.633 --> 02:35.218
I went through all the tests.

11
02:36.178 --> 02:40.974
Had my blood drawn, gave a urine sample, had things attached to my chest,

12
02:41.808 --> 02:44.352
and even ran in place until they told me to stop.

13
02:49.691 --> 02:50.942
[mouse scrolling]

14
02:51.026 --> 02:56.239
Your test results show no abnormalities with your heart.

15
03:01.703 --> 03:02.788
And your symptom is…

16
03:04.164 --> 03:06.082
a racing heart?

17
03:07.083 --> 03:09.711
Do you know when a soldier is authorized to kill?

18
03:14.257 --> 03:18.637
I'm a soldier, so I even get rewarded for killing the enemy.

19
03:22.098 --> 03:26.937
Anyway, lately my heart's been pounding like it did

20
03:27.020 --> 03:29.898
when I was about to make my first kill.

21
03:36.071 --> 03:40.575
There are many possible causes of an abnormal heartbeat.

22
03:40.659 --> 03:41.826
[hums]

23
03:41.910 --> 03:45.997
In your case, I think it may be psychological.

24
03:48.583 --> 03:50.085
But this is a surgical department.

25
03:53.672 --> 03:56.341
How do you manage to sleep at night?

26
04:02.514 --> 04:06.560
I don't have to answer questions that aren't medically relevant, do I?

27
04:15.277 --> 04:17.612
[chair slides]

28
04:22.617 --> 04:24.411
When I attack the enemy…

29
04:25.787 --> 04:29.374
I strike fast and aggressively, catching them off guard.

30
04:29.457 --> 04:30.792
That's how I operate.

31
04:30.876 --> 04:32.878
[♪ chilling music plays]

32
04:33.795 --> 04:35.547
If I get the chance…

33
04:38.425 --> 04:40.385
I won't hesitate for even a second.

34
04:45.056 --> 04:47.225
[nurse] Sir, your consultation is over.

35
04:47.309 --> 04:48.935
Please wait outside.

36
04:59.321 --> 05:00.697
Too much stress…

37
05:02.866 --> 05:04.200
isn't good for your heart.

38
05:14.628 --> 05:16.087
[door closes]

39
05:18.548 --> 05:24.679
EPISODE 7 MONSTER

40
05:29.351 --> 05:31.978
[Jieun] We've already talked about this. It's over. We need to stop.

41
05:32.062 --> 05:33.480
[Junghyeon] Come on, Jieun. Wait.

42
05:33.563 --> 05:34.940
Let's go somewhere and talk.

43
05:35.023 --> 05:36.816
You haven't been answering my calls.

44
05:37.442 --> 05:38.526
[Jieun] You need to leave!

45
05:38.610 --> 05:39.736
[♪ uneasy music playing]

46
05:39.819 --> 05:40.820
[Junghyeon] Jieun.

47
05:41.446 --> 05:42.697
[door opens]

48
05:44.491 --> 05:45.617
[door closes]

49
06:02.801 --> 06:04.052
[car chirps]

50
06:05.345 --> 06:06.596
[Jisun] Junghyeon.

51
06:07.764 --> 06:09.140
What are you doing here?

52
06:11.434 --> 06:12.978
Oh, well…

53
06:14.771 --> 06:17.983
The surgery schedule suddenly changed, so I came to tell your sister.

54
06:20.902 --> 06:22.362
You could've called her.

55
06:23.780 --> 06:26.491
Yeah, but it's a really important surgery,

56
06:26.574 --> 06:28.159
so I thought I'd tell her in person.

57
06:28.243 --> 06:30.161
But I'm really busy, so I should get going.

58
06:30.245 --> 06:31.246
See you later.

59
06:34.624 --> 06:36.334
[engine starts]

60
06:46.011 --> 06:48.388
[Jisun] Hyeongsu's out exercising after dropping the kids off?

61
06:48.471 --> 06:51.516
Yeah, he says he's gaining weight around his waist. [chuckles]

62
06:52.434 --> 06:54.269
-Want some coffee? -Yeah.

63
06:56.438 --> 06:58.106
What brings you here so early?

64
07:00.525 --> 07:03.111
I put my house up for sale. Priced it low for a quick sale.

65
07:05.155 --> 07:06.740
I don't know what to feel.

66
07:06.823 --> 07:07.949
[Jieun] Mmm.

67
07:08.575 --> 07:09.701
I see.

68
07:11.619 --> 07:13.747
I'm sure you'll find a good buyer.

69
07:13.830 --> 07:14.914
[Jisun] Yeah.

70
07:19.043 --> 07:21.921
And I wanted to drop this off.

71
07:25.633 --> 07:26.760
[exclaims]

72
07:28.011 --> 07:30.722
Oh, this. I was wondering where I'd put it…

73
07:30.805 --> 07:32.432
It was in Junghyeon's car.

74
07:36.019 --> 07:37.437
Oh…

75
07:37.520 --> 07:39.898
Junghyeon came looking for you.

76
07:40.774 --> 07:42.942
It was raining, so I lent it to him.

77
07:45.361 --> 07:47.197
She must've left it in my car by accident.

78
07:47.280 --> 07:51.493
She was getting wet in the rain the other day, so I gave her a ride.

79
07:55.413 --> 07:57.749
-You lent it to him? -[Jieun] Yeah.

80
07:58.708 --> 07:59.918
Want milk in your coffee?

81
08:00.877 --> 08:02.462
You don't take syrup, right?

82
08:05.256 --> 08:07.926
If you lent it to him, how come you didn't know where it was?

83
08:10.428 --> 08:12.055
And it didn't rain that day.

84
08:17.602 --> 08:18.895
Oh, it didn't?

85
08:20.772 --> 08:25.318
[chuckles] Gosh, I've been so scatterbrained with the kids lately.

86
08:25.401 --> 08:28.154
I swear my brain's turning to mush.

87
08:28.238 --> 08:29.906
That's why I need coffee.

88
08:30.532 --> 08:32.200
Do you want anything else?

89
08:32.283 --> 08:34.077
Junghyeon told me a different story.

90
08:38.915 --> 08:40.875
Huh? That's weird.

91
08:40.959 --> 08:43.002
Even just now, I ran into Junghyeon.

92
08:46.339 --> 08:48.591
Oh, well, maybe he was just passing by.

93
08:55.056 --> 08:56.641
Why are you lying to me?

94
09:01.604 --> 09:03.106
[Jieun] What are you talking about?

95
09:03.982 --> 09:05.942
Junghyeon had that same look on his face.

96
09:06.693 --> 09:08.403
Like he wanted me to stop asking.

97
09:10.405 --> 09:11.906
He was acting strange earlier too.

98
09:11.990 --> 09:14.284
Why are you being so sensitive?

99
09:14.367 --> 09:17.036
You always get hung up on the smallest things--

100
09:17.120 --> 09:20.498
Don't make it sound like I'm the one acting weird!

101
09:23.376 --> 09:25.378
I saw you talking to Junghyeon.

102
09:25.461 --> 09:26.838
Don't lie to me, Jieun.

103
09:31.259 --> 09:32.594
What's going on?

104
09:32.677 --> 09:33.970
Why can't you tell me?

105
09:39.475 --> 09:40.894
[Jieun] Because it's over now.

106
09:45.398 --> 09:47.650
[♪ uneasy music plays]

107
09:51.154 --> 09:52.697
You and Junghyeon…

108
09:55.074 --> 09:56.326
[Jieun sighs]

109
10:06.419 --> 10:07.712
[exhales deeply]

110
10:14.135 --> 10:15.637
You see, we…

111
10:18.097 --> 10:21.226
We were both exhausted, Hyeongsu and I.

112
10:23.228 --> 10:25.855
So whenever I saw Junghyeon at the hospital,

113
10:26.981 --> 10:28.733
it felt like I could finally relax.

114
10:29.609 --> 10:31.110
He always made me laugh, and…

115
10:33.029 --> 10:36.074
I don't even know why I did it.

116
10:42.830 --> 10:47.043
You were the only person in the world I could trust.

117
10:47.126 --> 10:49.128
So how could you lie to me, Jieun?

118
10:49.212 --> 10:51.923
It meant nothing. It was just a mistake, Jisun.

119
10:53.091 --> 10:54.384
[door opens]

120
10:55.426 --> 10:56.928
[Hyeongsu] Honey, I'm home.

121
10:57.470 --> 10:59.013
Man, it's hot.

122
10:59.806 --> 11:01.933
Oh, Jisun, you're here too?

123
11:06.354 --> 11:07.522
Hey.

124
11:08.898 --> 11:10.024
[door opens]

125
11:10.984 --> 11:13.444
-Honey, did something happen? -[door closes]

126
11:26.082 --> 11:27.709
There's something I need to tell you.

127
11:38.386 --> 11:41.472
[attorney] Defamation, spreading false information,

128
11:41.556 --> 11:45.018
making false accusations of sexual assault, trespassing…

129
11:45.643 --> 11:48.354
Oh, and add threats and stalking.

130
11:49.939 --> 11:51.232
Nice. That's brutal.

131
11:52.567 --> 11:54.944
You've got the whole package there.

132
11:55.028 --> 11:56.029
But…

133
11:56.529 --> 11:59.949
I'm thinking of making her pay in a way that's more fitting than a lawsuit.

134
12:00.742 --> 12:01.868
[knocks on door]

135
12:03.202 --> 12:05.079
Yeah. Let's do that.

136
12:05.580 --> 12:06.581
All right.

137
12:08.791 --> 12:10.918
Hello, sir. What brings you here?

138
12:11.002 --> 12:13.880
[director] What do you think of the design for the Cardiovascular Center?

139
12:16.090 --> 12:17.216
It looks great.

140
12:18.301 --> 12:20.470
Guess who the director's going to be?

141
12:20.553 --> 12:21.554
Who?

142
12:22.138 --> 12:23.765
It's you, man.

143
12:24.515 --> 12:25.516
What?

144
12:25.600 --> 12:28.978
Thanks to you, our brand recognition has jumped from eleventh to third place.

145
12:30.396 --> 12:33.691
You better get us to number one while you're running the center.

146
12:34.859 --> 12:35.860
[sighs]

147
12:51.793 --> 12:52.794
Jisun.

148
13:00.093 --> 13:02.845
Your sister told me what happened, but you've got it all wrong.

149
13:07.558 --> 13:09.852
Did you move to Sangcheon because of my sister?

150
13:09.936 --> 13:11.229
-No. -[Jisun] Was she the reason

151
13:11.312 --> 13:12.980
you approached me in the first place?

152
13:13.064 --> 13:15.274
Were you seeing her while you were also dating me?

153
13:15.358 --> 13:17.777
What are you talking about? Of course not.

154
13:18.778 --> 13:20.822
You two must've had a good laugh at my expense.

155
13:20.905 --> 13:22.532
You've got it all wrong.

156
13:23.032 --> 13:26.577
It's nothing like what you're imagining.

157
13:27.745 --> 13:28.788
It was just…

158
13:29.789 --> 13:31.457
[exhales sharply] It was just a brief thing.

159
13:31.541 --> 13:33.292
People make mistakes, don't they?

160
13:34.043 --> 13:36.045
Does one mistake have to invalidate everything

161
13:36.129 --> 13:37.797
-about me? -Park Junghyeon.

162
13:38.464 --> 13:39.841
Were you ever really my friend?

163
13:39.924 --> 13:42.385
Yes, I was. I still am.

164
13:42.468 --> 13:43.761
I can't trust anyone anymore.

165
13:43.845 --> 13:45.012
[Junghyeon] Jisun, wait…

166
13:48.182 --> 13:51.185
Look, I'm sorry, and I know how confused you must be,

167
13:51.811 --> 13:55.690
but you're overreacting a little by taking it this far.

168
13:59.527 --> 14:03.156
-Jisun, what I'm trying to say is-- -Don't make it sound like I'm the problem.

169
14:08.828 --> 14:09.829
[Junghyeon] Jisun.

170
14:23.092 --> 14:25.052
[♪ eerie music plays]

171
14:27.305 --> 14:31.017
MAY 5 INTERESTED

172
14:31.100 --> 14:33.477
CAN WE MEET IN PERSON?

173
14:37.565 --> 14:39.192
WEEKLY BESTSELLERS

174
14:39.275 --> 14:41.068
GHB, DATE-RAPE DRUG, 50 ML

175
14:41.152 --> 14:42.862
PREMIUM ICE CRYSTALS, 1 G

176
14:42.945 --> 14:45.072
NO IN-PERSON DEALS

177
14:50.328 --> 14:53.998
PAYFUN OR CRYPTO ONLY

178
14:56.167 --> 15:00.463
I'M OLD-SCHOOL, I PREFER CASH I'LL PAY 20% EXTRA

179
15:05.468 --> 15:06.510
200%

180
15:08.054 --> 15:09.055
[typing]

181
15:10.932 --> 15:12.391
DEAL

182
15:12.475 --> 15:13.851
[person] Tomorrow at 8:00 p.m.

183
15:14.477 --> 15:16.103
Leave the payment by the fire hydrant

184
15:16.187 --> 15:18.314
on the east side of Crown Village, second floor.

185
15:21.901 --> 15:23.653
-12 10-ML BOTTLES? -ONLY 5-ML BOTTLES

186
15:23.736 --> 15:25.947
-HOW MUCH LONGER? -I'LL LET YOU KNOW

187
15:26.030 --> 15:29.075
[person] Once payment is confirmed, pick up the goods today at 8:00 p.m.

188
15:29.158 --> 15:32.078
by the fire hydrant on the west side of Crown Village, third floor.

189
16:24.255 --> 16:26.215
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

190
17:06.297 --> 17:08.382
[♪ fast-paced music plays]

191
17:30.321 --> 17:31.864
[panting]

192
17:55.096 --> 17:56.222
[Hwayoung yelps]

193
17:57.473 --> 17:59.850
-[groans] -Gosh, are you okay?

194
18:00.476 --> 18:02.103
Goodness. You should've been careful.

195
18:02.186 --> 18:04.397
Man… Are you all right?

196
18:04.480 --> 18:05.690
[Hwayoung] I'm sorry.

197
18:24.959 --> 18:26.502
[♪ tense music playing]

198
18:41.350 --> 18:42.351
[Hwayoung sighs]

199
19:10.337 --> 19:12.339
[♪ sinister music plays]

200
19:44.663 --> 19:45.664
[Hwayoung] Damn it.

201
19:58.594 --> 20:00.346
I feel sickened by it all.

202
20:02.765 --> 20:05.059
CLINIC DIRECTOR KIM JIAN

203
20:05.142 --> 20:08.646
I feel confused and helpless…

204
20:14.193 --> 20:16.695
I'm just so angry at him that I can't stand it.

205
20:17.696 --> 20:19.824
[Jian] What happened between you and this man?

206
20:19.907 --> 20:21.492
He sexually assaulted me.

207
20:22.993 --> 20:24.161
[Jian] Oh, dear.

208
20:24.787 --> 20:26.330
Did you report it?

209
20:27.164 --> 20:28.499
It didn't do any good.

210
20:29.708 --> 20:33.128
They said there wasn't enough evidence, so he wasn't punished at all.

211
20:35.381 --> 20:38.300
[paper tearing]

212
20:42.513 --> 20:44.515
Something similar happened to me before.

213
20:45.850 --> 20:48.519
Back then, I tried to put it behind me as quickly as possible

214
20:48.602 --> 20:49.728
and pull myself together.

215
20:50.479 --> 20:52.314
I tried everything I could think of.

216
20:52.898 --> 20:57.069
Counseling, meditation, art therapy, 108 bows, pilgrimages to sacred sites…

217
21:00.281 --> 21:02.199
But none of it helped.

218
21:09.123 --> 21:12.042
The people who committed these crimes should be the ones suffering.

219
21:15.170 --> 21:18.340
But instead, I feel like I'm the one losing everything,

220
21:19.508 --> 21:22.261
becoming some kind of troublemaker who's not right in the head.

221
21:23.053 --> 21:25.180
While those bastards live their lives just fine.

222
21:26.098 --> 21:27.349
[♪ heavy music plays]

223
21:29.476 --> 21:32.271
Ms. Kang, let's try to stop thinking about it for a minute--

224
21:32.354 --> 21:33.981
I have no one on my side.

225
21:36.775 --> 21:38.986
I can't even trust the people I used to trust.

226
21:41.363 --> 21:44.533
But none of this is my fault. I know it isn't.

227
21:56.045 --> 21:58.505
[nurse] Ms. Kang Jisun, your medication is ready.

228
21:59.256 --> 22:01.967
Oh, sorry. I forgot.

229
22:09.600 --> 22:10.601
Here you go.

230
22:11.894 --> 22:13.145
[card reader beeps]

231
22:19.318 --> 22:24.823
FOR WHEN I AM WEAK, THEN I AM STRONG

232
22:49.264 --> 22:50.683
[Junho] Mother, I'm here.

233
22:50.766 --> 22:52.101
[caregiver] Oh, good to see you.

234
22:52.184 --> 22:53.352
[Junho chuckles] Hello.

235
22:53.435 --> 22:56.772
The physical therapist is here, helping her with her exercises.

236
22:56.855 --> 22:59.066
She's been waiting for you for quite a while.

237
22:59.149 --> 23:00.609
Come on in.

238
23:02.319 --> 23:03.862
[physical therapist] Just put it down.

239
23:03.946 --> 23:05.197
That's it.

240
23:05.280 --> 23:08.325
Now your left foot, just a little. Well done.

241
23:08.409 --> 23:10.244
Okay, one more time.

242
23:10.327 --> 23:11.912
Left foot…

243
23:11.996 --> 23:14.456
Put your weight on it, and…

244
23:15.457 --> 23:16.834
left foot.

245
23:16.917 --> 23:18.002
Well done.

246
23:19.920 --> 23:21.547
Are you feeling a little better?

247
23:21.630 --> 23:22.798
[physical therapist chuckles]

248
23:22.881 --> 23:25.426
Seeing you must've given her a boost.

249
23:25.509 --> 23:27.594
She's moving much more smoothly all of a sudden.

250
23:28.679 --> 23:29.930
Please help her make up

251
23:30.014 --> 23:32.182
-for all the sessions she's missed. -[physical therapist] Okay.

252
23:32.266 --> 23:34.393
[Junho's mom slurring] Go upstairs.

253
23:35.144 --> 23:36.603
[caregiver] She wants you to go upstairs.

254
23:37.104 --> 23:40.065
I think she doesn't want you to see her struggling.

255
23:40.149 --> 23:42.151
Okay, I'll be upstairs.

256
23:42.234 --> 23:44.236
But you have to finish your session today.

257
23:44.319 --> 23:45.738
-Okay. -All right.

258
23:50.993 --> 23:52.786
Let's start with your right foot again.

259
24:01.920 --> 24:03.964
[♪ tense music plays]

260
26:48.962 --> 26:52.132
These are your favorite flowers.

261
26:56.929 --> 26:57.930
Marguerites.

262
27:00.432 --> 27:01.516
They mean…

263
27:04.645 --> 27:06.188
"true love."

264
27:10.484 --> 27:12.611
[♪ gentle music plays]

265
27:12.694 --> 27:15.822
My daughter saw Junho giving our cat some treats.

266
27:17.199 --> 27:20.369
Where did you take our cat?

267
27:20.452 --> 27:22.204
What did you do to it?

268
27:26.875 --> 27:29.628
Junho, tell me.

269
27:30.462 --> 27:32.172
Did you hide the cat?

270
27:33.507 --> 27:34.967
I haven't seen it.

271
27:39.054 --> 27:40.055
[neighbor exhales sharply]

272
27:40.722 --> 27:42.015
[door closes]

273
27:42.099 --> 27:43.100
[Mother] Junho.

274
27:43.809 --> 27:44.810
Gosh.

275
27:46.603 --> 27:47.604
Junho…

276
27:52.025 --> 27:53.068
[gasps]

277
27:53.151 --> 27:54.861
[♪ ominous music overlaps]

278
27:59.866 --> 28:00.867
[gasps]

279
28:09.626 --> 28:10.752
[sighs]

280
28:12.546 --> 28:13.839
Do you remember?

281
28:15.674 --> 28:18.176
The first time you caught me lying.

282
28:21.722 --> 28:23.724
You were so angry with me.

283
28:24.891 --> 28:27.185
-[water running] -[Mother] Lying is filthy.

284
28:27.728 --> 28:29.438
[Junho] You scrubbed my mouth so hard…

285
28:29.521 --> 28:32.482
[Mother] You have to wash that filthy mouth clean.

286
28:33.233 --> 28:35.861
…with soapy water.

287
28:50.292 --> 28:52.794
[♪ gentle piano playing]

288
29:10.395 --> 29:12.397
[♪ dark music overlaps]

289
29:40.050 --> 29:41.510
[♪ piano playing stops]

290
29:43.845 --> 29:45.680
[♪ uneasy music plays]

291
30:07.410 --> 30:08.662
I love you,

292
30:10.288 --> 30:11.373
Mother.

293
30:36.857 --> 30:38.024
[door opens]

294
30:38.650 --> 30:40.026
[door closes]

295
30:44.447 --> 30:47.492
[doorbell rings]

296
30:56.793 --> 30:57.794
Huh?

297
30:59.921 --> 31:01.214
Why me?

298
31:05.177 --> 31:08.513
[doorbell rings]

299
31:10.348 --> 31:11.892
[gasps]

300
31:13.268 --> 31:14.269
This guy…

301
31:14.352 --> 31:16.438
[Realtor] You wanted us to sell the house quickly, right?

302
31:16.521 --> 31:18.440
I was going to show the buyer around myself,

303
31:18.523 --> 31:21.151
but another client came in with an urgent deal. [chuckles]

304
31:21.234 --> 31:24.404
It'll be just one guy, and he can stop by at any time.

305
31:29.242 --> 31:32.287
-Oh, sorry to keep you waiting. -Oh, no, that's okay.

306
31:32.370 --> 31:34.247
-[Realtor] Shall we go in? Right this way. -Sure.

307
31:36.583 --> 31:40.045
[doorbell rings]

308
31:40.128 --> 31:41.546
[Realtor] Ma'am!

309
31:41.630 --> 31:42.964
Are you home?

310
31:43.924 --> 31:46.718
That's strange. She said she'd be home.

311
31:54.017 --> 31:55.852
[phone ringing]

312
31:55.936 --> 31:56.937
Shoot!

313
31:59.564 --> 32:01.608
I can hear a phone ringing inside.

314
32:01.691 --> 32:03.026
Could she be asleep?

315
32:04.903 --> 32:06.655
-[doorbell rings] -[phone ringing stops]

316
32:06.738 --> 32:10.283
-Ma'am, we're here to see the house! -[Jisun sighs]

317
32:10.367 --> 32:11.534
Sparkle Real Estate!

318
32:12.285 --> 32:13.703
[banging on door]

319
32:13.787 --> 32:14.788
Ma'am?

320
32:15.997 --> 32:17.749
[Jisun] Yes, I know…

321
32:20.252 --> 32:22.504
[Realtor] Oh, you are home. Great. [chuckles]

322
32:22.587 --> 32:24.130
We'll just have a look around then.

323
32:24.214 --> 32:25.757
Come on in. Right this way.

324
32:38.895 --> 32:39.896
[♪ gentle music plays]

325
32:39.980 --> 32:44.150
Yes. Wow, this place is perfect for someone living alone. [laughs]

326
32:44.234 --> 32:45.944
Come on in and take a look, sir.

327
32:46.027 --> 32:47.153
Please, come in.

328
32:47.237 --> 32:49.531
[Realtor] Wow, it's southeast-facing!

329
32:49.614 --> 32:52.742
You'll get plenty of sunlight all day, starting in the morning!

330
32:52.826 --> 32:54.953
Now, this way to the master bedroom.

331
32:55.036 --> 32:56.454
Right over there.

332
32:56.538 --> 32:58.373
This is the master bedroom.

333
32:58.456 --> 33:00.083
Wow, it's spacious!

334
33:00.166 --> 33:03.003
You could put some built-in wardrobes along this wall.

335
33:03.086 --> 33:06.589
It'd make the room really nice and cozy, don't you think? [laughs]

336
33:07.257 --> 33:11.177
Looks like that area's been renovated too.

337
33:12.721 --> 33:14.264
Oh, wow.

338
33:15.390 --> 33:17.892
Why don't you take a look at the bathroom too?

339
33:17.976 --> 33:18.977
Here.

340
33:20.937 --> 33:23.315
-[water running] -The water pressure's great too!

341
33:23.398 --> 33:24.607
[Realtor laughs]

342
33:24.691 --> 33:27.110
And there's a window, so you get good ventilation.

343
33:27.193 --> 33:29.279
-Thank you for showing us around. -Sure.

344
33:30.280 --> 33:31.698
-[Realtor] We'll be going now. -Okay.

345
33:31.781 --> 33:33.575
[Realtor] Oh, and one more thing.

346
33:33.658 --> 33:35.702
Don't list the house with any other agents.

347
33:35.785 --> 33:36.786
I'll find you a buyer.

348
33:36.870 --> 33:39.539
-Okay. -All right, then. Bye.

349
33:39.622 --> 33:40.790
Let's go.

350
33:46.546 --> 33:48.006
[door locks]

351
33:50.133 --> 33:51.968
[water boiling]

352
33:53.345 --> 33:54.971
[phone ringing]

353
34:00.727 --> 34:01.728
Hello?

354
34:01.811 --> 34:04.439
[Realtor] Ma'am, check your bank account.

355
34:04.522 --> 34:06.775
The man who viewed your house earlier, Kim Namu,

356
34:06.858 --> 34:08.943
says he's transferred the deposit to hold it.

357
34:10.987 --> 34:12.197
Already?

358
34:12.280 --> 34:14.366
He says you can choose the moving date.

359
34:14.449 --> 34:17.285
He's living in company housing, so he's flexible.

360
34:17.369 --> 34:20.497
He must've really liked the place. [laughs]

361
34:24.667 --> 34:26.211
-[paper shuffling] -[Realtor] Take your time

362
34:26.294 --> 34:27.337
and read through it. [chuckles]

363
34:27.420 --> 34:28.421
Okay.

364
34:28.505 --> 34:30.465
[Realtor] Since you haven't found a new place yet,

365
34:30.548 --> 34:32.592
I've set the moving date well into the future.

366
34:32.675 --> 34:34.969
We can discuss it and finalize the date before then.

367
34:35.678 --> 34:36.679
Does that sound okay?

368
34:37.347 --> 34:38.348
[Realtor chuckles]

369
34:39.516 --> 34:40.558
Now, sign here, please.

370
34:40.642 --> 34:41.893
-Yes. -Here.

371
34:56.157 --> 34:57.158
[Namu] Wait.

372
35:00.662 --> 35:04.332
Do you happen to know any good places to eat around here?

373
35:06.209 --> 35:07.293
Places to eat?

374
35:07.794 --> 35:10.088
Yeah, I thought I'd ask while I'm here.

375
35:10.714 --> 35:12.090
And it's lunchtime anyway.

376
35:14.342 --> 35:16.052
What kind of food?

377
35:17.929 --> 35:19.472
Anything's fine.

378
35:19.556 --> 35:21.141
I'm not a picky eater.

379
35:23.143 --> 35:24.686
Well, there's…

380
35:26.187 --> 35:28.606
There's a place across the street that serves ssambap.

381
35:28.690 --> 35:31.401
Oh. Do they serve single portions?

382
35:32.235 --> 35:33.820
They might not.

383
35:33.903 --> 35:35.989
-Let me think of somewhere else-- -Actually…

384
35:38.116 --> 35:40.952
Would you like to have lunch together, if you don't mind?

385
35:48.626 --> 35:52.505
After we eat, you can just go on your way.

386
35:56.176 --> 35:59.721
You gave me a good deal on the house, so I just wanted to thank you.

387
36:01.973 --> 36:04.017
But if you'd rather not, just say so.

388
36:10.190 --> 36:11.733
[patrons chattering]

389
36:15.361 --> 36:17.947
I've been meaning to come here, but never got around to it.

390
36:19.491 --> 36:22.911
Whenever I pass by, there's always a long line outside.

391
36:26.456 --> 36:28.082
-Here you go. -[Jisun] Thank you.

392
36:31.878 --> 36:32.879
Come to think of it,

393
36:32.962 --> 36:35.799
there are quite a few places around here I still haven't tried.

394
36:47.435 --> 36:48.728
[Namu] Thank you.

395
36:50.104 --> 36:51.523
-[server] Enjoy your meal. -Thank you.

396
36:52.315 --> 36:53.483
[Namu exclaims]

397
36:54.192 --> 36:55.819
This place really is amazing.

398
36:57.779 --> 36:59.614
-Let's dig in. -[Namu] Let's.

399
37:06.579 --> 37:08.289
You saw the articles?

400
37:10.959 --> 37:13.545
Then you must know about what happened…

401
37:14.295 --> 37:17.674
[Namu] I did read them but I didn't believe them.

402
37:18.466 --> 37:21.302
[groans] The reporting was terrible.

403
37:22.554 --> 37:25.056
They were trying to completely ruin my reputation.

404
37:25.723 --> 37:27.183
I even lost my job because of it.

405
37:30.895 --> 37:32.063
Hold on.

406
37:34.190 --> 37:36.401
Then did you already know about my house when you…

407
37:36.484 --> 37:37.819
Oh, no.

408
37:37.902 --> 37:39.320
Please don't get the wrong idea.

409
37:41.239 --> 37:42.740
[phone ringing]

410
37:42.824 --> 37:44.075
NOLBU REAL ESTATE

411
37:44.158 --> 37:45.493
[Namu] Yes, hello?

412
37:45.577 --> 37:47.287
[Realtor] Hello, this is Nolbu Real Estate.

413
37:47.370 --> 37:49.163
You haven't found a house yet, have you?

414
37:49.914 --> 37:50.915
I actually have.

415
37:51.666 --> 37:53.418
I found a place that matched my budget.

416
37:54.335 --> 37:56.254
[exclaims] Really?

417
37:56.337 --> 37:58.548
Is it that detached house listed for a quick sale?

418
37:58.631 --> 38:00.925
-The one where a woman lives alone? -Yes.

419
38:01.009 --> 38:03.887
That house isn't a good choice.

420
38:03.970 --> 38:06.556
It's best to avoid places where something bad has happened.

421
38:07.056 --> 38:08.182
What happened there?

422
38:08.725 --> 38:13.104
Well, it's a little awkward to bring up, but you should know.

423
38:14.063 --> 38:18.067
The woman living there was in the news for being sexually assaulted.

424
38:18.151 --> 38:19.235
Sexual assault?

425
38:19.736 --> 38:22.280
But some say she was after the man's money.

426
38:22.363 --> 38:25.158
Anyway, it sounds like she's got some issues.

427
38:25.658 --> 38:27.952
I know you're a man, but you'll be living alone too.

428
38:28.036 --> 38:30.371
I'd stay away from a place with that kind of history.

429
38:31.539 --> 38:32.874
I don't care about that.

430
38:32.957 --> 38:34.626
I've already agreed to buy it.

431
38:34.709 --> 38:35.960
I see.

432
38:36.044 --> 38:37.462
All right then.

433
38:38.296 --> 38:39.797
All right, thank you.

434
38:40.965 --> 38:42.216
[call disconnects]

435
38:45.762 --> 38:47.388
Hey, wait.

436
38:48.264 --> 38:49.891
-Wait-- -Don't touch me!

437
38:49.974 --> 38:51.392
[Jisun panting]

438
38:53.728 --> 38:55.813
Have you ever been through something like this?

439
38:58.441 --> 39:04.989
Something happens, and overnight, it's like your whole world has changed.

440
39:05.823 --> 39:07.075
Why me?

441
39:15.416 --> 39:16.542
[Namu] Actually…

442
39:18.419 --> 39:20.213
ever since we parted ways that day…

443
39:22.340 --> 39:24.133
I've thought about you from time to time.

444
39:25.718 --> 39:27.428
I've been curious about you.

445
39:30.807 --> 39:33.309
I even wished I'd asked for your number.

446
39:36.062 --> 39:38.648
But the house?

447
39:38.731 --> 39:41.609
I swear to God, that was a complete coincidence.

448
39:42.110 --> 39:44.028
I feel like I'm being unfairly accused here.

449
39:44.112 --> 39:46.030
This just doesn't feel right.

450
39:53.454 --> 39:54.455
[Namu] Sorry?

451
39:56.582 --> 39:58.668
[Jisun] After everything I've been through to get here…

452
40:03.423 --> 40:05.508
I love my home and this neighborhood so much.

453
40:10.638 --> 40:13.099
And there are still so many restaurants I haven't tried.

454
40:15.393 --> 40:17.353
I'll never get to see this ocean again.

455
40:19.439 --> 40:21.733
Why should I be the one who has to run away again?

456
40:23.943 --> 40:25.361
[Namu sighs]

457
40:27.238 --> 40:29.032
You're right. That's not fair at all.

458
40:33.077 --> 40:34.287
I'm not moving.

459
40:36.664 --> 40:39.167
Sorry, but I can't just leave like this. It's too unfair.

460
40:59.520 --> 41:02.815
I'm really sorry for causing you so much trouble.

461
41:03.566 --> 41:04.567
[Namu chuckles softly]

462
41:05.276 --> 41:06.360
It's okay.

463
41:07.653 --> 41:09.280
We all have moments like that.

464
41:13.284 --> 41:14.744
When we cause trouble for others?

465
41:17.038 --> 41:18.206
No.

466
41:20.249 --> 41:23.711
Moments when it feels like life is being cruel only to you.

467
41:30.635 --> 41:32.303
You know, Mr. Kim Namu,

468
41:33.763 --> 41:35.598
I think you're a really good person.

469
41:41.187 --> 41:42.772
I'm glad.

470
41:42.855 --> 41:44.107
About what?

471
41:45.191 --> 41:46.818
You said you love it here,

472
41:47.985 --> 41:49.278
especially the ocean.

473
41:52.740 --> 41:54.242
I was hoping…

474
41:56.035 --> 41:58.788
you wouldn't leave, Jisun.

475
42:11.259 --> 42:15.429
Well, I hope you find an even better house and that everything works out for you.

476
42:20.893 --> 42:22.145
Will you be okay?

477
42:24.647 --> 42:25.857
What do you mean?

478
42:29.944 --> 42:30.945
Just…

479
42:32.029 --> 42:33.030
everything…

480
42:39.537 --> 42:41.372
Not everything is okay.

481
42:44.500 --> 42:46.002
But things will get better.

482
42:52.216 --> 42:53.384
Jisun.

483
42:55.469 --> 42:59.056
There's nothing wrong with you.

484
43:03.436 --> 43:04.437
Sorry?

485
43:06.439 --> 43:07.982
You're not strange

486
43:08.941 --> 43:10.693
and you're not overly sensitive.

487
43:13.988 --> 43:18.159
You're doing really well, Jisun.

488
43:28.544 --> 43:29.879
Thank you.

489
43:59.951 --> 44:01.911
What's with that guy?

490
44:13.172 --> 44:16.008
-INTERESTED -CAN WE MEET IN PERSON?

491
44:16.092 --> 44:19.679
DELETED ACCOUNT LAST ACTIVE A LONG TIME AGO

492
44:25.268 --> 44:26.269
[Hwayoung yelps]

493
44:29.605 --> 44:30.940
[sighs]

494
44:44.120 --> 44:46.163
[♪ pensive music plays]

495
44:54.755 --> 44:56.507
SEARCH HIGH-PAYING GIGS FOR MINORS

496
45:03.848 --> 45:05.558
[psychiatrist] I put in a good word for you.

497
45:05.641 --> 45:09.061
Turns out a former classmate of mine knows the director of that clinic.

498
45:09.812 --> 45:10.813
Thank you.

499
45:11.522 --> 45:13.399
I owe you a drink somewhere nice next time.

500
45:15.359 --> 45:16.694
[call disconnects]

501
45:24.452 --> 45:25.745
[door opens]

502
45:27.121 --> 45:28.748
[door closes]

503
45:31.459 --> 45:36.130
The director at White told me you're a doctor.

504
45:37.048 --> 45:38.799
It's nice to meet you at last.

505
45:38.883 --> 45:42.053
I wonder when we medical professionals will finally be safe from patients

506
45:42.136 --> 45:43.721
who might try to kill us.

507
45:46.390 --> 45:48.809
Here's the medical report on Kang Jisun.

508
45:48.893 --> 45:50.186
Thank you.

509
45:52.021 --> 45:55.232
"Elevated levels of depression and anger,

510
45:55.316 --> 45:59.070
with a risk of self-harm or other dangerous behavior."

511
46:02.990 --> 46:07.328
If she's shown signs of illegal or violent behavior driven by delusions…

512
46:09.497 --> 46:12.041
it would be safer to have her committed, right?

513
46:13.334 --> 46:14.335
Committed?

514
46:15.378 --> 46:17.296
You mean hospitalizing her against her will?

515
46:21.467 --> 46:22.468
[patrons chattering]

516
46:22.551 --> 46:25.054
Excuse me. I'm with the police.

517
46:25.930 --> 46:27.098
[owner] Okay.

518
46:28.974 --> 46:29.975
Number 50.

519
46:30.059 --> 46:32.144
Just head straight down that way.

520
46:40.027 --> 46:41.654
"Romantic Monster"?

521
46:46.492 --> 46:50.538
You know GHB is a narcotic, right?

522
46:54.250 --> 46:56.085
The person selling it

523
46:58.045 --> 47:00.881
posted an online ad offering high pay for delivery jobs.

524
47:00.965 --> 47:03.801
SIMPLE DELIVERY ERRANDS MINORS WELCOME, NO FACE-TO-FACE CONTACT

525
47:03.884 --> 47:05.386
"Romantic Monster."

526
47:07.138 --> 47:10.015
We found messages exchanged using your account.

527
47:12.560 --> 47:15.729
Did you deliver it without knowing what it was?

528
47:22.528 --> 47:24.029
Did someone tell you to do it?

529
47:29.410 --> 47:30.411
Min Junho.

530
47:32.204 --> 47:33.747
We called your father.

531
47:34.957 --> 47:37.585
You don't have to talk right now if you don't want to. But…

532
47:44.842 --> 47:46.552
[Junho] Hyunsoo, what's going on?

533
47:52.391 --> 47:54.643
-Get up. -I'm still questioning him.

534
48:00.357 --> 48:03.152
As you know, drug couriers…

535
48:05.154 --> 48:06.697
We call them runners.

536
48:08.574 --> 48:11.535
Even though he's underage and claims he didn't know what it was,

537
48:12.995 --> 48:16.207
he could still be sent to a juvenile detention center.

538
48:18.167 --> 48:19.835
Do you have any evidence?

539
48:19.919 --> 48:21.253
We're still investigating.

540
48:25.049 --> 48:26.383
[Junho sighs]

541
48:27.510 --> 48:28.511
By any chance…

542
48:30.429 --> 48:36.185
Do you know who may have ordered your son to transport GHB, Mr. Min?

543
48:38.687 --> 48:40.356
[♪ tense music plays]

544
48:49.698 --> 48:53.202
When are you due?

545
48:57.289 --> 48:58.916
As you know…

546
49:01.085 --> 49:04.421
there are things we'd never want our children to see.

547
49:06.131 --> 49:08.801
Things you'd never want them to know.

548
49:10.678 --> 49:14.390
I hope you have a healthy delivery.

549
49:15.140 --> 49:16.183
Everyone…

550
49:19.103 --> 49:22.231
pays the price for what they've done.

551
49:46.589 --> 49:50.134
[Jisun] "He who fights with monsters should look to it

552
49:50.926 --> 49:53.512
that he himself does not become a monster."

553
49:55.973 --> 49:58.517
"For when we gaze into the abyss of a monster,

554
50:00.352 --> 50:01.562
the abyss also…

555
50:04.648 --> 50:06.775
gazes back into us."

556
50:24.752 --> 50:26.170
[Junho] Nice place for a cup of tea.

557
50:33.177 --> 50:35.220
I'm reporting you for trespassing and stalking.

558
50:36.138 --> 50:37.389
[Junho] Got any proof?

559
50:38.807 --> 50:39.975
Because I do.

560
50:44.313 --> 50:46.357
[♪ disquieting music plays]

561
50:52.029 --> 50:53.072
[clattering]

562
51:03.165 --> 51:06.335
You're threatening me with that now?

563
51:08.003 --> 51:10.673
Let's forgo the dirt we have on each other.

564
51:12.508 --> 51:13.884
What do you want?

565
51:15.386 --> 51:17.054
Hyunsoo's been falsely accused.

566
51:18.931 --> 51:20.724
I think the friend he's trying to protect

567
51:20.808 --> 51:24.061
is the same girl I lied for at the hospital before.

568
51:25.479 --> 51:26.563
Kim Soyeon.

569
51:30.651 --> 51:34.613
She's the one who used his account to sell knockoff sneakers before.

570
51:35.906 --> 51:38.909
I want you to talk to her.

571
51:40.452 --> 51:42.705
Tell her that if she doesn't turn herself in,

572
51:42.788 --> 51:43.997
things will only get worse.

573
51:46.166 --> 51:48.877
He's your son. Why don't you do it yourself?

574
51:49.670 --> 51:51.004
[Junho] I can't get a hold of her.

575
51:52.548 --> 51:55.759
I think she has the wrong idea that I'm pressuring her to protect my son.

576
52:00.389 --> 52:01.765
And besides…

577
52:03.934 --> 52:07.020
I figured you'd be better at encouraging her to tell the truth than me,

578
52:08.397 --> 52:12.985
being her teacher and all, Ms. Kang Jisun.

579
52:15.904 --> 52:18.574
I'm giving you a chance.

580
52:19.616 --> 52:23.287
If you pull this off, I'm willing to drop the lawsuit.

581
52:41.638 --> 52:45.851
[Hwayoung] We still haven't identified the seller or the buyer.

582
52:48.020 --> 52:52.357
That kid hasn't said a single word since he got here.

583
52:59.740 --> 53:01.450
Let me try talking to him.

584
53:19.259 --> 53:21.887
[♪ lively music plays]

585
53:26.517 --> 53:28.727
Last time we were here,

586
53:29.812 --> 53:34.149
you wanted us to be friends, remember?

587
53:48.956 --> 53:51.416
They say you have to come back for questioning tomorrow.

588
53:52.668 --> 53:56.171
And it might keep going until you tell them something.

589
54:06.306 --> 54:07.683
[Hyunsoo] You really didn't do it?

590
54:11.645 --> 54:12.855
Lie, I mean.

591
54:20.404 --> 54:24.533
Answer me first, and then I'll tell you.

592
54:28.453 --> 54:29.621
That delivery job…

593
54:32.708 --> 54:34.001
It wasn't you, was it?

594
54:41.174 --> 54:42.175
Could it be…

595
54:42.259 --> 54:43.552
[bells on door jingle]

596
54:49.641 --> 54:50.642
Soyeon.

597
54:57.316 --> 54:58.442
[Soyeon] It wasn't him.

598
55:02.195 --> 55:03.322
It was me.

599
55:08.243 --> 55:11.955
Min Hyunsoo didn't know anything about it.

600
55:15.542 --> 55:17.669
It was all me. I did it using his account.

601
55:19.379 --> 55:21.882
He got caught selling knockoff sneakers too.

602
55:21.965 --> 55:23.550
That was also me.

603
55:24.217 --> 55:26.011
And you took that delivery job too?

604
55:34.561 --> 55:38.148
I know where the people running that operation are based.

605
55:38.231 --> 55:40.025
[♪ foreboding music plays]

606
55:42.569 --> 55:46.198
I left my phone where I made the delivery, so I went back for it.

607
55:46.865 --> 55:50.035
I saw those people drive off,

608
55:50.118 --> 55:52.162
and then I saw the same car outside my academy.

609
55:52.245 --> 55:53.246
[team leader] Kim Jinuk.

610
55:53.830 --> 55:57.668
[Soyeon] But then, I ran into the same people again.

611
56:00.045 --> 56:01.838
[Jinuk sighs] Damn it.

612
56:03.590 --> 56:05.467
[typing]

613
56:11.723 --> 56:13.892
[Junho] This is the last round, right?

614
56:20.107 --> 56:21.316
[Hyunsoo sighs]

615
56:23.402 --> 56:25.821
Did Ms. Kang get fired from school because of you, Dad?

616
56:29.449 --> 56:30.951
It wasn't because of me.

617
56:31.785 --> 56:33.245
Why?

618
56:33.328 --> 56:35.706
I was just wondering if she could come back to school.

619
56:38.375 --> 56:39.751
That's not going to happen.

620
56:39.835 --> 56:42.879
In a just society, people who do wrong have to face the consequences.

621
56:43.922 --> 56:45.674
And I'm really angry with you this time.

622
56:46.550 --> 56:48.760
You know Soyeon isn't a good friend for you.

623
56:50.971 --> 56:53.598
Don't be reckless and take the blame for someone else again.

624
56:57.436 --> 56:59.229
Dad, did you really love Mom?

625
57:05.986 --> 57:07.404
What?

626
57:09.865 --> 57:11.575
If you did, then you should understand.

627
57:12.743 --> 57:15.412
Sometimes, you just want to do that for someone.

628
57:27.632 --> 57:28.759
The buyer list.

629
57:28.842 --> 57:30.093
There isn't one.

630
57:30.677 --> 57:33.054
You sell drugs and don't keep track of your customers?

631
57:33.638 --> 57:36.099
If you go to prison this time, you're not getting out.

632
57:36.183 --> 57:38.643
I told you, I don't have one. What do you want me to do?

633
57:38.727 --> 57:40.020
[water running]

634
57:46.067 --> 57:47.444
-[pedal clangs] -[water running]

635
57:52.657 --> 57:53.825
[Junho] It's not easy, is it?

636
57:55.202 --> 57:57.579
-[Jieun] The patient held up well. -[pedal clangs]

637
57:57.662 --> 57:59.498
Not the surgery. I meant life in general.

638
57:59.998 --> 58:01.208
Family…

639
58:02.626 --> 58:03.752
and personal matters too.

640
58:09.925 --> 58:11.718
[pedal clangs]

641
58:11.802 --> 58:12.928
Dr. Kang Jieun.

642
58:16.515 --> 58:17.682
We need to talk.

643
58:18.391 --> 58:20.769
I don't want to interfere in your family affairs,

644
58:20.852 --> 58:22.854
but there's something we need to discuss.

645
58:28.276 --> 58:32.030
PATIENT: KANG JISUN DIAGNOSIS: DELUSIONAL DISORDER

646
58:32.113 --> 58:34.449
She falsely accused me and broke into my home.

647
58:35.784 --> 58:39.204
And she even drugged, abducted, and held me captive.

648
58:44.125 --> 58:46.920
Ms. Kang Jisun is in a dangerous situation right now.

649
58:47.838 --> 58:49.506
[Jisun] There's no point resisting anyway, so…

650
58:50.257 --> 58:51.716
[Jisun grunts]

651
58:52.467 --> 58:56.221
Stop struggling and just accept it.

652
58:59.599 --> 59:01.476
CONSENT TO HOSPITALIZATION

653
59:01.560 --> 59:03.478
Rather than having her sentenced to prison,

654
59:04.271 --> 59:05.772
she needs treatment.

655
59:05.856 --> 59:07.941
It's the only way to protect your sister.

656
59:10.861 --> 59:11.862
Are you saying…

657
59:14.072 --> 59:16.157
you want me to have my own sister committed?

658
59:20.245 --> 59:21.413
I can't.

659
59:21.913 --> 59:22.914
I won't.

660
59:32.424 --> 59:34.634
Even if your relationship with Mr. Park Junghyeon…

661
59:37.971 --> 59:39.139
comes to light?

662
59:41.474 --> 59:43.560
INCOMING CALL JIEUN

663
59:51.192 --> 59:53.612
MALIGNANT NARCISSISTS AND THEIR VICTIMS

664
59:53.695 --> 59:54.988
WHO IS THE REAL CULPRIT?

665
01:00:03.455 --> 01:00:07.709
Jisun, Dr. Min Junho came to see me to threaten me.

666
01:00:07.792 --> 01:00:10.795
He has footage of you putting him in the car and driving away,

667
01:00:10.879 --> 01:00:13.006
and the footage of you entering his house.

668
01:00:13.089 --> 01:00:14.466
Is any of this true?

669
01:00:15.717 --> 01:00:17.552
[♪ foreboding music plays]

670
01:00:18.470 --> 01:00:19.596
[officer] Ma'am.

671
01:00:29.439 --> 01:00:30.523
Sir.

672
01:00:32.067 --> 01:00:33.068
Let's go.

673
01:01:03.264 --> 01:01:04.432
Min Junho!

674
01:01:20.073 --> 01:01:21.533
[♪ ominous music plays]

675
01:01:24.244 --> 01:01:25.495
[Hwayoung] Min Junho,

676
01:01:26.329 --> 01:01:29.040
you're under arrest for violating the Narcotics Control Act.

677
01:01:33.503 --> 01:01:35.797
Well, I've still got one ace up my sleeve.

678
01:01:38.466 --> 01:01:39.592
Tell me everything.

679
01:01:40.301 --> 01:01:42.679
If it's not the guy I'm looking for, the deal's off.

680
01:01:42.762 --> 01:01:43.763
[officer] Ma'am.

681
01:02:08.246 --> 01:02:10.040
[♪ calm music plays]

682
01:02:33.813 --> 01:02:37.734
THE PERFECT LIE

683
01:03:02.801 --> 01:03:03.843
[Hwayoung] He'll be prosecuted.

684
01:03:05.845 --> 01:03:08.056
I think he recorded what he did to me.

685
01:03:08.848 --> 01:03:12.310
[Hwayoung] We'll have to find another way now.

686
01:03:12.393 --> 01:03:15.355
[person] It looks like you're heading out to sea to dump a body or something.

687
01:03:15.438 --> 01:03:16.898
Can I really trust you?

688
01:03:20.401 --> 01:03:22.987
We have to stop anyone else from becoming a victim.

689
01:03:23.071 --> 01:03:25.073
[Junho] Don't let that woman leave.

690
01:03:26.616 --> 01:03:30.495
-[siren blaring] -[Jisun] So it's really over now.

691
01:03:36.918 --> 01:03:38.419
[♪ theme song playing]

692
01:03:47.137 --> 01:03:48.763
THE PERFECT LIE

693
01:03:48.847 --> 01:03:50.849
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
